{"id":"3930e297a315728a","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-fhodtt-terms.md","title":"项、转换与有限推导","display":"df-fhodtt-terms — 项、转换与有限推导","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-fhodtt-terms","aliases":["16-df-fhodtt-terms","FHoDTT term rules"],"display":"df-fhodtt-terms — 项、转换与有限推导","depends_on":["[[16-df-fhodtt-syntax]]"],"review_status":"source-rule-core-reconstructed","review_priority":"P1","review_note_id":"J04","review_date":"2026-10-16","source":"§11.5, p. 688 (PDF 708); §11.4, pp. 674–676 (PDF 694–696); §10.1 dependent product beta/eta","review_scope":"Annotated two-sort term, beta/eta, structural and finite derivation rules; split semantic interpretation","revision_date":"2026-10-19"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-fhodtt-terms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-fhodtt-terms</span><span>FHoDTT term rules</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fhodtt-terms — 项、转换与有限推导"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca2d757f82798122\" href=\"?note=ca2d757f82798122\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-syntax\">16-df-fhodtt-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"review_status","html":"source-rule-core-reconstructed"},{"key":"review_priority","html":"P1"},{"key":"review_note_id","html":"J04"},{"key":"review_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"source","html":"§11.5, p. 688 (PDF 708); §11.4, pp. 674–676 (PDF 694–696); §10.1 dependent product beta/eta"},{"key":"review_scope","html":"Annotated two-sort term, beta/eta, structural and finite derivation rules; split semantic interpretation"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-19"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FHoDTT}\">\\(\\mathrm{FHoDTT}\\)</span> 是下节用有限推导树定义的演算标识；不预先假定任何未显示的规则。采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca2d757f82798122\" href=\"?note=ca2d757f82798122\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-syntax\">16-df-fhodtt-syntax</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V,S,e,\\Gamma,\\mathcal A_\\Sigma,\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{form}}\">\\(V,S,e,\\Gamma,\\mathcal A_\\Sigma,\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{form}}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash M:C\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash M:C\\)</span> 及同类型判断等式分别记为 formation、term 与 equality 判断；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 换名按原始语法取商。</li>\n<li>各构造子的完整节点及声明的 sort 标签采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca2d757f82798122\" href=\"?note=ca2d757f82798122\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-syntax\">16-df-fhodtt-syntax</a>。本页显示的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,x.D,z.E\">\\(C,x.D,z.E\\)</span> 固定对应节点的全部注释；规则实例化时连同项一起替换这些注释，绑定变量按各自作用域取新鲜。以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Type}\">\\(\\mathsf{Type}\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Kind}\">\\(\\mathsf{Kind}\\)</span> 为右端的形成判断是统一类型判断的特例。</li>\n<li>下式的模式元变量遍历相应原始表达式和原始语境；只检查文法、绑定和显式 sort 侧条件，判断是否可推导仅由规则的前提决定。绑定变量新鲜；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t,u\\in S\">\\(s,t,u\\in S\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{app}(f,a)\">\\(\\operatorname{app}(f,a)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,b)\">\\((a,b)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{split}_{z.E}(p;x,y.d)\">\\(\\operatorname{split}_{z.E}(p;x,y.d)\\)</span> 在 sort 标记由当前规则确定时省去标记。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{tm}}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{tm}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\beta\\eta}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\beta\\eta}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{str}}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{str}}\\)</span> 由下文带标号模式的有限集合定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\Delta\\Rightarrow\\Gamma\">\\(\\sigma:\\Delta\\Rightarrow\\Gamma\\)</span> 表示下面递归给出的上下文替换。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C:s\">\\(C:s\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M:C\">\\(M:C\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\equiv e&#39;:C\">\\(e\\equiv e&#39;:C\\)</span> 这种判断体，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 是连同上下文的完整判断；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j[\\sigma]\">\\(j[\\sigma]\\)</span> 是所有表达式的捕获避免替换。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E[-]\">\\(E[-]\\)</span> 为一个单孔表达式上下文，孔处的绑定环境必须与等式前提的上下文相同；填孔不捕获自由变量。判断等式可作用于项或 sort 相同的 type/kind 表达式。</li>\n<li>有限推导树是有限有根树，节点标记为 judgment；节点的子节点标签按序为某个规则实例的全部前提，节点标签为该实例结论。下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tree}(D)\">\\(\\operatorname{Tree}(D)\\)</span> 表示有限有根树这一基础组合对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lab}_D(v)\">\\(\\operatorname{lab}_D(v)\\)</span> 为节点标签，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{prem}_D(v)\">\\(\\operatorname{prem}_D(v)\\)</span> 为其子节点标签序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Inst}(r)\">\\(\\operatorname{Inst}(r)\\)</span> 为对模式元变量作所有符合原始文法、绑定及显式 sort 侧条件的元层替换得到的规则实例集；不以待定义的可推导性筛选实例。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"v\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma,x:C,\\Delta\\ \\mathsf{ctx}}{\\Gamma,x:C,\\Delta\\vdash x:C},\\qquad\n1_i\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}}{\\Gamma\\vdash()_s:1_s}\\quad(s\\in S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[v\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma,x:C,\\Delta\\ \\mathsf{ctx}}{\\Gamma,x:C,\\Delta\\vdash x:C},\\qquad\n1_i\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}}{\\Gamma\\vdash()_s:1_s}\\quad(s\\in S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_i\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash b:D\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\\quad\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash D:t}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda^{s,t}x:C.b:\\Pi^{s,t}(x:C).D},\\qquad\n\\Pi_e\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash f:\\Pi^{s,t}(x:C).D\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash a:C}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{app}(f,a):D[a/x]}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi_i\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash b:D\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\\quad\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash D:t}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda^{s,t}x:C.b:\\Pi^{s,t}(x:C).D},\\qquad\n\\Pi_e\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash f:\\Pi^{s,t}(x:C).D\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash a:C}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{app}(f,a):D[a/x]}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_i\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash a:C\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash b:D[a/x]\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\\quad\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash D:t}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash(a,b):\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_i\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash a:C\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash b:D[a/x]\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\\quad\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash D:t}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash(a,b):\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_e\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma,z:\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D\\vdash E:u\\quad\n\\Gamma,x:C,y:D\\vdash d:E[(x,y)/z]\\quad(s,t,u)\\in\\mathcal A_\\Sigma}\n{\\Gamma,z:\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D\\vdash\n\\operatorname{split}_{z.E}(z;x,y.d):E}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_e\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma,z:\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D\\vdash E:u\\quad\n\\Gamma,x:C,y:D\\vdash d:E[(x,y)/z]\\quad(s,t,u)\\in\\mathcal A_\\Sigma}\n{\\Gamma,z:\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D\\vdash\n\\operatorname{split}_{z.E}(z;x,y.d):E}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"1_\\eta\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash a:1_s}{\\Gamma\\vdash a\\equiv()_s:1_s},\\qquad\n\\Pi_\\beta\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\\quad\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash D:t\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash a:C\\quad\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash b:D}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{app}(\\lambda x:C.b,a)\\equiv b[a/x]:D[a/x]}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[1_\\eta\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash a:1_s}{\\Gamma\\vdash a\\equiv()_s:1_s},\\qquad\n\\Pi_\\beta\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\\quad\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash D:t\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash a:C\\quad\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash b:D}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{app}(\\lambda x:C.b,a)\\equiv b[a/x]:D[a/x]}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_\\eta\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\\quad\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash D:t\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash f:\\Pi^{s,t}(x:C).D\\quad x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(f)}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda x:C.\\operatorname{app}(f,x)\\equiv f:\\Pi^{s,t}(x:C).D}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi_\\eta\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\\quad\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash D:t\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash f:\\Pi^{s,t}(x:C).D\\quad x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(f)}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda x:C.\\operatorname{app}(f,x)\\equiv f:\\Pi^{s,t}(x:C).D}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_\\beta\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash a:C\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash b:D[a/x]\\quad\n\\Gamma,x:C,y:D\\vdash d:E[(x,y)/z]\\quad\n\\Gamma,z:\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D\\vdash E:u\\quad(s,t,u)\\in\\mathcal A_\\Sigma}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{split}_{z.E}((a,b);x,y.d)\\equiv\nd[a/x,b/y]:E[(a,b)/z]}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_\\beta\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash a:C\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash b:D[a/x]\\quad\n\\Gamma,x:C,y:D\\vdash d:E[(x,y)/z]\\quad\n\\Gamma,z:\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D\\vdash E:u\\quad(s,t,u)\\in\\mathcal A_\\Sigma}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{split}_{z.E}((a,b);x,y.d)\\equiv\nd[a/x,b/y]:E[(a,b)/z]}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_\\eta\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma,z:\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D\\vdash Q:E\\quad\n\\Gamma,z:\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D\\vdash E:u\\quad(s,t,u)\\in\\mathcal A_\\Sigma}\n{\\Gamma,z:\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D\\vdash\n\\operatorname{split}_{z.E}(z;x,y.Q[(x,y)/z])\\equiv Q:E}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_\\eta\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma,z:\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D\\vdash Q:E\\quad\n\\Gamma,z:\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D\\vdash E:u\\quad(s,t,u)\\in\\mathcal A_\\Sigma}\n{\\Gamma,z:\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D\\vdash\n\\operatorname{split}_{z.E}(z;x,y.Q[(x,y)/z])\\equiv Q:E}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s_0\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Delta\\ \\mathsf{ctx}}{():\\Delta\\Rightarrow()},\\qquad\ns_+\\coloneqq\\frac{\\sigma:\\Delta\\Rightarrow\\Gamma\\quad\\Delta\\vdash a:C[\\sigma]\\quad\\Gamma,x:C\\ \\mathsf{ctx}}\n{(\\sigma,a):\\Delta\\Rightarrow\\Gamma,x:C}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s_0\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Delta\\ \\mathsf{ctx}}{():\\Delta\\Rightarrow()},\\qquad\ns_+\\coloneqq\\frac{\\sigma:\\Delta\\Rightarrow\\Gamma\\quad\\Delta\\vdash a:C[\\sigma]\\quad\\Gamma,x:C\\ \\mathsf{ctx}}\n{(\\sigma,a):\\Delta\\Rightarrow\\Gamma,x:C}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"w\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash j\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\\quad x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)}\n{\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash j},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{sub}\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash j\\quad\\sigma:\\Delta\\Rightarrow\\Gamma}{\\Delta\\vdash j[\\sigma]}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[w\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash j\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\\quad x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)}\n{\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash j},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{sub}\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash j\\quad\\sigma:\\Delta\\Rightarrow\\Gamma}{\\Delta\\vdash j[\\sigma]}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"c\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:C\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash C\\equiv D:s}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash M:D},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ceq}\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M\\equiv N:C\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash C\\equiv D:s}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash M\\equiv N:D}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[c\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:C\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash C\\equiv D:s}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash M:D},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ceq}\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M\\equiv N:C\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash C\\equiv D:s}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash M\\equiv N:D}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{refl}\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash e:C}{\\Gamma\\vdash e\\equiv e:C},\\quad\n\\mathrm{sym}\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash e\\equiv e&#39;:C}{\\Gamma\\vdash e&#39;\\equiv e:C},\\quad\n\\mathrm{trans}\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash e\\equiv e&#39;:C\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash e&#39;\\equiv e&#39;&#39;:C}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash e\\equiv e&#39;&#39;:C}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{refl}\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash e:C}{\\Gamma\\vdash e\\equiv e:C},\\quad\n\\mathrm{sym}\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash e\\equiv e&#39;:C}{\\Gamma\\vdash e&#39;\\equiv e:C},\\quad\n\\mathrm{trans}\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash e\\equiv e&#39;:C\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash e&#39;\\equiv e&#39;&#39;:C}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash e\\equiv e&#39;&#39;:C}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cong}\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash e\\equiv e&#39;:C\\quad\\Delta\\vdash E[e]:D\\quad\\Delta\\vdash E[e&#39;]:D}\n{\\Delta\\vdash E[e]\\equiv E[e&#39;]:D},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ctxconv}\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash C\\equiv D:s\\quad\\Gamma,x:C,\\Delta\\vdash j}\n{\\Gamma,x:D,\\Delta\\vdash j}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cong}\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash e\\equiv e&#39;:C\\quad\\Delta\\vdash E[e]:D\\quad\\Delta\\vdash E[e&#39;]:D}\n{\\Delta\\vdash E[e]\\equiv E[e&#39;]:D},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ctxconv}\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash C\\equiv D:s\\quad\\Gamma,x:C,\\Delta\\vdash j}\n{\\Gamma,x:D,\\Delta\\vdash j}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{tm}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{v,1_i,\\Pi_i,\\Pi_e,\\Sigma_i,\\Sigma_e\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal R_{\\beta\\eta}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{1_\\eta,\\Pi_\\beta,\\Pi_\\eta,\\Sigma_\\beta,\\Sigma_\\eta\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{str}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{s_0,s_+,w,\\mathrm{sub},c,\\mathrm{ceq},\\mathrm{refl},\\mathrm{sym},\\mathrm{trans},\\mathrm{cong},\\mathrm{ctxconv}\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{form}}\\cup\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{tm}}\\cup\n\\mathcal R_{\\beta\\eta}\\cup\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{str}},\\\\\n\\mathsf{TermRules}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{tm}}\\cup\\mathcal R_{\\beta\\eta},\\\\\n\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{J\\ \\middle|\\ \\exists D\\ \\left[\n\\operatorname{Tree}(D)\\land\\operatorname{lab}_D(\\operatorname{root}D)=J\\land\n\\forall v\\in D\\ \\exists r\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}\\quad\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{prem}_D(v),\\operatorname{lab}_D(v)\\bigr)\\in\\operatorname{Inst}(r)\n\\right]\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{FHoDTT}\\vdash J&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow J\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{tm}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{v,1_i,\\Pi_i,\\Pi_e,\\Sigma_i,\\Sigma_e\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal R_{\\beta\\eta}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{1_\\eta,\\Pi_\\beta,\\Pi_\\eta,\\Sigma_\\beta,\\Sigma_\\eta\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{str}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{s_0,s_+,w,\\mathrm{sub},c,\\mathrm{ceq},\\mathrm{refl},\\mathrm{sym},\\mathrm{trans},\\mathrm{cong},\\mathrm{ctxconv}\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{form}}\\cup\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{tm}}\\cup\n\\mathcal R_{\\beta\\eta}\\cup\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{str}},\\\\\n\\mathsf{TermRules}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{tm}}\\cup\\mathcal R_{\\beta\\eta},\\\\\n\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{J\\ \\middle|\\ \\exists D\\ \\left[\n\\operatorname{Tree}(D)\\land\\operatorname{lab}_D(\\operatorname{root}D)=J\\land\n\\forall v\\in D\\ \\exists r\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}\\quad\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{prem}_D(v),\\operatorname{lab}_D(v)\\bigr)\\in\\operatorname{Inst}(r)\n\\right]\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{FHoDTT}\\vdash J&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow J\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：§11.5，p. 688（PDF 708）的单位、四种乘积与四种和；和的 strong/very strong 消去及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta/\\eta\">\\(\\beta/\\eta\\)</span> 见 §11.4，pp. 674–676（PDF 694–696）。函数的依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta/\\eta\">\\(\\beta/\\eta\\)</span> 按 §10.1 的乘积规则。六个项模式、五个转换模式、十一个结构模式均列为显示的有限集合；有限树定义排除了自循环推导。</li>\n<li>只有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type})\">\\((\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type})\\)</span>-和的消去目标受限为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Type}\">\\(\\mathsf{Type}\\)</span>。尤其不能给这种强和无条件加入第一投影到 kind；Proposition 11.4.2，p. 676（PDF 696）明确解释此限制。其他三种很强和可派生第一、第二投影及配对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>本轮补齐了旧草稿缺少的单位、四种 sort 组合、强度侧条件、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta/\\eta\">\\(\\beta/\\eta\\)</span>、结构规则和最小有限推导闭包。规则集合是已显示模式的集合，不再用一个没有成员定义的名字代表完整系统。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi\">\\(\\Pi\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta/\\eta\">\\(\\beta/\\eta\\)</span> 模式显式携带 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C:s,D:t\">\\(C:s,D:t\\)</span> 的形成前提，确定被省略的构造子 sort 标记；不能在只检查原始树的模式实例化阶段任意选择标记。原始树含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Kind}\">\\(\\mathsf{Kind}\\)</span> 后，反身规则亦可合法实例化于 kind 表达式的判断等式；这没有提供 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Kind}\">\\(\\mathsf{Kind}\\)</span> 的更高分类公理。</li>\n<li>这是按本书语法草图重建的基础规则呈现；没有加入宇宙累积、独立 Prop、归纳类型或 equality reflection。<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f94e7143755d4851\" href=\"?note=f94e7143755d4851\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-cat-model\">16-df-fhodtt-cat-model</a> 给出匹配的严格语境族模型和递归解释，<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0fc14f4a062b4abf\" href=\"?note=0fc14f4a062b4abf\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-term-model\">16-df-fhodtt-term-model</a> 构造其句法商模型；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7b655ef4974b8266\" href=\"?note=7b655ef4974b8266\" title=\"16-thm-fhodtt-soundness\">16-thm-fhodtt-soundness</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"32520a37e4beb365\" href=\"?note=32520a37e4beb365\" title=\"16-thm-fhodtt-completeness\">16-thm-fhodtt-completeness</a> 分别给该严格版本的规则归纳与语义反射。普通非分裂范畴模型的相干解释不是这些定理的量词范围。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"ca2d757f82798122","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fhodtt-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"ca2d757f82798122","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FHoDTT}$ 是下节用有限推导树定义的演算标识；不预先假定任何未显示的规则。采用 [[16-df-fhodtt-syntax]] 的 $V,S,e,\\Gamma,\\mathcal A_\\Sigma,\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{form}}$。$\\Gamma\\vdash C:s$、$\\Gamma\\vdash M:C$ 及同类型判断等式分别记为 formation、term 与 equality 判断；$\\alpha$ 换名按原始语法取商。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"ca2d757f82798122","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"各构造子的完整节点及声明的 sort 标签采用 [[16-df-fhodtt-syntax]]。本页显示的 $C,x.D,z.E$ 固定对应节点的全部注释；规则实例化时连同项一起替换这些注释，绑定变量按各自作用域取新鲜。以 $\\mathsf{Type}$ 或 $\\mathsf{Kind}$ 为右端的形成判断是统一类型判断的特例。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-cat-model","status":"resolved","id":"f94e7143755d4851","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这是按本书语法草图重建的基础规则呈现；没有加入宇宙累积、独立 Prop、归纳类型或 equality reflection。[[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]] 给出匹配的严格语境族模型和递归解释，[[16-df-fhodtt-term-model]] 构造其句法商模型；[[16-thm-fhodtt-soundness]]、[[16-thm-fhodtt-completeness]] 分别给该严格版本的规则归纳与语义反射。普通非分裂范畴模型的相干解释不是这些定理的量词范围。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-term-model","status":"resolved","id":"0fc14f4a062b4abf","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这是按本书语法草图重建的基础规则呈现；没有加入宇宙累积、独立 Prop、归纳类型或 equality reflection。[[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]] 给出匹配的严格语境族模型和递归解释，[[16-df-fhodtt-term-model]] 构造其句法商模型；[[16-thm-fhodtt-soundness]]、[[16-thm-fhodtt-completeness]] 分别给该严格版本的规则归纳与语义反射。普通非分裂范畴模型的相干解释不是这些定理的量词范围。","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-fhodtt-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"7b655ef4974b8266","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这是按本书语法草图重建的基础规则呈现；没有加入宇宙累积、独立 Prop、归纳类型或 equality reflection。[[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]] 给出匹配的严格语境族模型和递归解释，[[16-df-fhodtt-term-model]] 构造其句法商模型；[[16-thm-fhodtt-soundness]]、[[16-thm-fhodtt-completeness]] 分别给该严格版本的规则归纳与语义反射。普通非分裂范畴模型的相干解释不是这些定理的量词范围。","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-fhodtt-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"32520a37e4beb365","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这是按本书语法草图重建的基础规则呈现；没有加入宇宙累积、独立 Prop、归纳类型或 equality reflection。[[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]] 给出匹配的严格语境族模型和递归解释，[[16-df-fhodtt-term-model]] 构造其句法商模型；[[16-thm-fhodtt-soundness]]、[[16-thm-fhodtt-completeness]] 分别给该严格版本的规则归纳与语义反射。普通非分裂范畴模型的相干解释不是这些定理的量词范围。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{FHoDTT}","display":false},{"tex":"V,S,e,\\Gamma,\\mathcal A_\\Sigma,\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{form}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash C:s","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash M:C","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"C,x.D,z.E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Type}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Kind}","display":false},{"tex":"s,t,u\\in S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{app}(f,a)","display":false},{"tex":"(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{split}_{z.E}(p;x,y.d)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{tm}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_{\\beta\\eta}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{str}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma:\\Delta\\Rightarrow\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"C:s","display":false},{"tex":"M:C","display":false},{"tex":"e\\equiv e':C","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"j[\\sigma]","display":false},{"tex":"E[-]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Tree}(D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lab}_D(v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{prem}_D(v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Inst}(r)","display":false},{"tex":"v\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma,x:C,\\Delta\\ \\mathsf{ctx}}{\\Gamma,x:C,\\Delta\\vdash x:C},\\qquad\n1_i\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}}{\\Gamma\\vdash()_s:1_s}\\quad(s\\in S).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pi_i\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash b:D\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\\quad\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash D:t}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda^{s,t}x:C.b:\\Pi^{s,t}(x:C).D},\\qquad\n\\Pi_e\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash f:\\Pi^{s,t}(x:C).D\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash a:C}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{app}(f,a):D[a/x]}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_i\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash a:C\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash b:D[a/x]\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\\quad\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash D:t}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash(a,b):\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_e\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma,z:\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D\\vdash E:u\\quad\n\\Gamma,x:C,y:D\\vdash d:E[(x,y)/z]\\quad(s,t,u)\\in\\mathcal A_\\Sigma}\n{\\Gamma,z:\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D\\vdash\n\\operatorname{split}_{z.E}(z;x,y.d):E}.","display":true},{"tex":"1_\\eta\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash a:1_s}{\\Gamma\\vdash a\\equiv()_s:1_s},\\qquad\n\\Pi_\\beta\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\\quad\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash D:t\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash a:C\\quad\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash b:D}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{app}(\\lambda x:C.b,a)\\equiv b[a/x]:D[a/x]}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pi_\\eta\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\\quad\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash D:t\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash f:\\Pi^{s,t}(x:C).D\\quad x\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(f)}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\lambda x:C.\\operatorname{app}(f,x)\\equiv f:\\Pi^{s,t}(x:C).D}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_\\beta\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash a:C\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash b:D[a/x]\\quad\n\\Gamma,x:C,y:D\\vdash d:E[(x,y)/z]\\quad\n\\Gamma,z:\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D\\vdash E:u\\quad(s,t,u)\\in\\mathcal A_\\Sigma}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash\\operatorname{split}_{z.E}((a,b);x,y.d)\\equiv\nd[a/x,b/y]:E[(a,b)/z]}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_\\eta\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma,z:\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D\\vdash Q:E\\quad\n\\Gamma,z:\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D\\vdash E:u\\quad(s,t,u)\\in\\mathcal A_\\Sigma}\n{\\Gamma,z:\\Sigma^{s,t}(x:C).D\\vdash\n\\operatorname{split}_{z.E}(z;x,y.Q[(x,y)/z])\\equiv Q:E}.","display":true},{"tex":"s_0\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Delta\\ \\mathsf{ctx}}{():\\Delta\\Rightarrow()},\\qquad\ns_+\\coloneqq\\frac{\\sigma:\\Delta\\Rightarrow\\Gamma\\quad\\Delta\\vdash a:C[\\sigma]\\quad\\Gamma,x:C\\ \\mathsf{ctx}}\n{(\\sigma,a):\\Delta\\Rightarrow\\Gamma,x:C}.","display":true},{"tex":"w\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash j\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash C:s\\quad x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(\\Gamma)}\n{\\Gamma,x:C\\vdash j},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{sub}\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash j\\quad\\sigma:\\Delta\\Rightarrow\\Gamma}{\\Delta\\vdash j[\\sigma]}.","display":true},{"tex":"c\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M:C\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash C\\equiv D:s}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash M:D},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ceq}\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash M\\equiv N:C\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash C\\equiv D:s}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash M\\equiv N:D}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{refl}\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash e:C}{\\Gamma\\vdash e\\equiv e:C},\\quad\n\\mathrm{sym}\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash e\\equiv e':C}{\\Gamma\\vdash e'\\equiv e:C},\\quad\n\\mathrm{trans}\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash e\\equiv e':C\\quad\\Gamma\\vdash e'\\equiv e'':C}\n{\\Gamma\\vdash e\\equiv e'':C}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cong}\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash e\\equiv e':C\\quad\\Delta\\vdash E[e]:D\\quad\\Delta\\vdash E[e']:D}\n{\\Delta\\vdash E[e]\\equiv E[e']:D},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{ctxconv}\\coloneqq\\frac{\\Gamma\\vdash C\\equiv D:s\\quad\\Gamma,x:C,\\Delta\\vdash j}\n{\\Gamma,x:D,\\Delta\\vdash j}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{tm}}&\\coloneqq\\{v,1_i,\\Pi_i,\\Pi_e,\\Sigma_i,\\Sigma_e\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal R_{\\beta\\eta}&\\coloneqq\\{1_\\eta,\\Pi_\\beta,\\Pi_\\eta,\\Sigma_\\beta,\\Sigma_\\eta\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{str}}&\\coloneqq\\{s_0,s_+,w,\\mathrm{sub},c,\\mathrm{ceq},\\mathrm{refl},\\mathrm{sym},\\mathrm{trans},\\mathrm{cong},\\mathrm{ctxconv}\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}&\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{form}}\\cup\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{tm}}\\cup\n\\mathcal R_{\\beta\\eta}\\cup\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{str}},\\\\\n\\mathsf{TermRules}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}&\\coloneqq\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{tm}}\\cup\\mathcal R_{\\beta\\eta},\\\\\n\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}&\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{J\\ \\middle|\\ \\exists D\\ \\left[\n\\operatorname{Tree}(D)\\land\\operatorname{lab}_D(\\operatorname{root}D)=J\\land\n\\forall v\\in D\\ \\exists r\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}\\quad\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{prem}_D(v),\\operatorname{lab}_D(v)\\bigr)\\in\\operatorname{Inst}(r)\n\\right]\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{FHoDTT}\\vdash J&\\Longleftrightarrow J\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\beta/\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta/\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Type}","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta/\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta/\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"C:s,D:t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Kind}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Kind}","display":false}],"bytes":8635,"backlinks":[{"id":"f94e7143755d4851","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4bbf6d604961cbb2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"严格版本使用同一依赖文件的 $\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}(S)$ 及其已递归构造的 $\\mathsf C_S,\\mathsf A^s_S$；$\\Gamma$ 良构且 $\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Type}$ 采用 [[16-df-fhodtt-terms]]。$S\\models^{\\mathrm{spl}}_\\Gamma A$ 是下文另外定义的关系，不对普通记录 $M$ 预设一套未给出的语法解释。 含部分值的合取由左向右求值：只有前置 $\\downarrow$ 守卫成立时，才求值后继含该值的式子。"},{"id":"df1066ccd01cf082","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"项与转换见 [[16-df-fhodtt-terms]]。本入口不把一般 DTT 签名、宇宙层级或额外 Prop 当作书中 FhoDTT 的形成结构。"},{"id":"ca2d757f82798122","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":4,"excerpt":"$\\Gamma\\vdash C:s$ 是同一个带类型表达式判断 $\\Gamma\\vdash e:D$ 在 $D=s$ 时的特例；它不是第二个无关联的判断标签。上下文良构、该统一类型判断、判断等式与替换判断的可导性由 [[16-df-fhodtt-terms]] 的同一个最小规则闭包定义。"},{"id":"0fc14f4a062b4abf","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[16-df-fhodtt-terms]] 的有限推导关系，省略固定下标 $\\mathrm{FHoDTT}$。语境的声明 $(x_i,s_i,C_i)$ 保留 sort 标签，固定 $V$ 的枚举 $(x_i)_{i\\ge1}$，语境声明变量按位置 $x_i$ 同名；内部绑定变量取 $\\alpha$ 类。$s,t,u\\in\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\}$。所有商均为集合的商；$[z]_{\\sim}$ 是相应等价类。$[\\Gamma]$、$[(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\sigma)]$ 分别按 $\\approx,\\sim_S$ 取类；$[(\\Gamma,C)]_s$、$[(\\Gamma,C,e)]_s$ 分别按 $\\sim_{A,s},\\sim_{E,s}$ 取类，故方括号的每种论域都有明确关系。"},{"id":"c921a3191bc6f9f0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{TermRules}_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}$ 是 [[16-df-fhodtt-terms]] 定义的项及 $\\beta/\\eta$ 规则集合；$\\mathcal D_{\\mathrm{FHoDTT}}$ 是其中连同形成、结构规则给出的有限推导 judgment 集。上标 $\\mathrm{legacy}$ 区分历史拼写。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-94","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-dtt-signature]]、[[16-df-split-dtt-structure]]、[[16-df-dtt-model]]、[[16-df-dtt-model-morphism]]、[[16-df-term-model]]、[[16-thm-term-model-initial]]、[[16-df-dtt-internal-language]]、[[16-thm-internal-language]]、[[16-thm-dtt-completeness]]、[[16-df-identity-type]]、[[16-df-identity-relative-equality]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-syntax]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-terms]]、[[16-df-split-fhodtt-structure]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-term-model]]、[[16-thm-fhodtt-soundness]]、[[16-thm-fhodtt-completeness]]、[[16-prop-fhodtt-kind-reflection]]。DTT 结果使用明确的强片段与严格态射；FHoDTT 的可靠性和完备性使用匹配其语法的两 sort 严格模型。内部语言评价是否覆盖整个模型，由语境生成条件判定。"},{"id":"97331c72a05275ec","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[16-df-fhodtt-syntax]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-terms]] 的混合语境、表达式集 $\\mathsf{Expr}$ 与有限推导关系 $\\mathrm{FHoDTT}\\vdash J$。固定良构 $\\Gamma$；$s\\in\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\}$。下节使用 [[16-df-category]] 的六元组编码构造 $\\mathcal T_\\Gamma,\\mathcal K_\\Gamma$；所有显示的绑定变量均对其所在上下文及其绑定域外的表达式新鲜；绑定名按 $\\alpha$ 等同。$[M]_{C,D}$ 表示转换类，$[M]:C\\to D$ 则简写带源靶标签的 $\\langle C,D,[M]_{C,D}\\rangle$。对象、箭头、恒等和复合的记录均在 Assertion 给出。"},{"id":"32520a37e4beb365","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"采用 [[16-df-fhodtt-terms]] 的演算，省略固定下标；$\\Gamma\\ \\mathsf{ctx}$ 且 $\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Type}$。$e$ 遍历带注释有限表达式集 $\\mathsf{Expr}$。"},{"id":"7b655ef4974b8266","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"使用 [[16-df-fhodtt-terms]] 的有限推导演算及带型属注释的原始表达式，省略固定下标 $\\mathrm{FHoDTT}$；$s\\in\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\}$。各显示的原始语境、表达式及替换量词在其有限树集合内取值。"}],"outgoing":["ca2d757f82798122","f94e7143755d4851","0fc14f4a062b4abf","7b655ef4974b8266","32520a37e4beb365"]}